  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is a solution of the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> , then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp; is equal to :"
  },
